# articles.voc — Definite articles o/a/os/as. A free-standing article right AFTER 'pelo'
# means it cannot be the contraction por+o (score_adp −8); after 'para' before a
# stoppable noun it supports parar (VERB). Core grammar — rarely extended.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

o
a
os
as
